sequenceDiagram
    actor App as Application
    participant Engine as Sufficiency Engine
    participant Model as Application model
    participant AGXAI

    App->>Engine: Task at application entry
    loop While missing information may be resolved
        Engine->>Model: Discover or reassess requirements
        Model-->>Engine: Requirement proposals
        opt Clarification is needed
            Engine-->>App: Questions
            App->>Engine: Answers
        end
    end
    Engine->>AGXAI: Record the assessment
    AGXAI-->>Engine: Audit references
    Engine-->>App: Readiness result
    Note over App: Application owns task execution
